TOUCH
=====

Create empty file or update timestamp.


BASIC
-----
touch newfile.txt

Creates empty file.


UPDATE TIMESTAMP
----------------
touch existing.txt

Updates "last modified" time.


CREATE MULTIPLE
---------------
touch file1.txt file2.txt file3.txt


WHEN TO USE
-----------
• Quick create empty file
• Create placeholder
• Update file modification date


TIPS
----
File is created but empty.
Use echo or cat to add content.
Useful for testing.


SEE ALSO
--------
echo > newfile.txt    Alternative way
cat > newfile.txt     For longer content
